posts.text:
For years, offshore oil and gas operators have tried to circumvent state rules and environmental protections to expand offshore drilling.   

@CongressMin, @SenAlexPadilla, and I have introduced legislation to establish stricter guardrails to ensure they are operating legally and safely. 

We must protect our coastlines.

